         <CEL MERGEACROSS="3">
<DTA TYPE="STRING">Note 1:  The diameter of the presser foot must be<MET> 56 mm</MET><ENG> 2.22 inches</ENG> and the pressure must be<MET> 20 kPa</MET><ENG> 2.9 psi</ENG>.  For other thickness options, see manufacturer's literature.</DTA>
